program leak_array_element_store

? Element-store discipline: typed string arrays own every slot, so
? overwriting a slot frees the old string first. Previously stores never
? freed the overwritten element and literal arrays never owned theirs.

@ main ||:
	expected: []

	arr: array[string] = [""]
	loop i:0 to 1000 do
		s: "v" + "w"
		arr[0] = s
	$
	print|arr[0]|
	expected.push|"vw"|

	arr[0] = "static"
	print|arr[0]|
	expected.push|"static"|

	print|expected|
$
